TRADEMARKS. A sponsor hoarding, a kit badge or a competition mark stays a trademark inside a
freely licensed photograph, and the licence grants nothing over it. Commons tags this file, and
again the tag is a floor: brand hoardings are legible in several frames it does not tag.

